quartered in Brussels, FEFCO has 17 Association members, all European national corrugated packaging organisations. The role of the Federation is to investigate economic, financial, technical and policy issues of interest to the corrugated packaging Industry, to analyse all factors which may influence the industry, and to promote and develop its reputation.',NULL,'2025-09-20 15:15:05'),(69119,'Smurfit Westrock is also a member of 4evergreen which is a cross-industry alliance with the goal of optimizing fibre-based packaging circularity and climate performance. As the industry value chain, 4evergreen wants to contribute to a climate-neutral society by perfecting the circularity of its members products. Its aim is to raise the overall recycling rate of fibre-based packaging to 90% by 2030.',NULL,'2025-09-20 15:15:06'),(69120,'EuropaBio: https://www.europabio.org/',NULL,'2025-09-20 15:15:06'),(69121,'Precision Fermentation Alliance: https://www.pfalliance.org/',NULL,'2025-09-20 15:15:06'),(69122,'France Deeptech: https://www.francedeeptech.org/',NULL,'2025-09-20 15:15:06'),(69123,'Ferments du Futur: https://www.fermentsdufutur.eu/',NULL,'2025-09-20 15:15:06'),(69124,'Protéines France: http://www.proteinesfrance.fr/',NULL,'2025-09-20 15:15:06'),(69125,'La French Tech: https://lafrenchtech.gouv.fr/fr/',NULL,'2025-09-20 15:15:06'),(69126,'As an example, ORMAZABAL is active member in AFBEL ,CONFEMETAL, SERCOBE, AEDIVE, AEE, UNEF, Alianza NetZero Mar, Cluster Marítimo Español, Foro Marítimo Vasco, Cluster de Energía del País Vasco, AELEC y UNE (Spain), ZVEI (Germany), GIMELEC (France), ANIMEE (Portugal), T&D EUROPE, ORGALIM, WIND EUROPE, AVERE, EOPSA, EURELECTRIC (EU), BusinessEurope etc.',NULL,'2025-09-20 15:15:08'),(69127,'The aim of ORMAZABAL membership in all those organizations is to collaborate in the impulse of the development of the present and future electrical infrastructures (i.e. Smart Grids)',NULL,'2025-09-20 15:15:08'),(69128,'European Water Association (https: