ather under the platform TURKONFED International.  See TURKONFED: https://turkonfed.org/en/page/about-us',NULL,'2025-09-20 15:17:06'),(69387,'European Chocolate, Biscuit and Confectionery Association (CAOBISCO): www.caobisco.eu',NULL,'2025-09-20 15:17:09'),(69388,'Aluminium France',NULL,'2025-09-20 15:17:11'),(69389,'The Dutch Trade Association of Proprietary Traders (APT) represents proprietary trading firms who trade for their own account and risk are crucial for the proper functioning of the stock exchange, are supervised by the Dutch regulators AFM and DNB (https://www.aptraders.nl).',NULL,'2025-09-20 15:17:12'),(69390,'Holland FinTech is the Fintech Association for the Netherlands. Their mission is to connect people and organizations within the fintech industry, enabling consumers and businesses to benefit from innovation and development (https://www.hollandFintech.com).',NULL,'2025-09-20 15:17:12'),(69391,'The VEUO is a representative organisation of listed companies which looks after the interests of companies listed at Euronext Amsterdam. Their purpose is to contribute to a well-functioning capital market in which listed companies can flourish (https://www.veuo.nl)',NULL,'2025-09-20 15:17:12'),(69392,'Regeneron is corporate member of the European Haemophilia Consortium and the European Federation of Allergy and Airways Diseases Patients\' Associations. Regeneron also supports the SPEAK UP for COPD coalition and is a member of the steering committee.',NULL,'2025-09-20 15:17:16'),(69393,'https://www.eu-asean.eu/',NULL,'2025-09-20 15:17:17'),(69394,'https://jri.org.ph/',NULL,'2025-09-20 15:17:17'),(69395,'Member of the group GG Dialogue Platform, The Global Gateway Civil Society and Local Authorities',NULL,'2025-09-20 15:17:18'),(69396,'Dialogue Platform (GG Dialogue Platform), the European commission\'s department of Human',NULL,'2025-09-20 15:17:18'),(69397,'Development, Migration, Governance and Peace.',NULL,'2025-09-20 15:17:18'),(69398,'Member of the Youth