acts also use advocacy campaigns to lobby governments to implement anti-corruption reforms.',NULL,'2025-09-20 15:25:51'),(70630,'Transparency International as a global movement works with a large number of other actors on specific aspects – national governments, international organisations, civil society, media, the private sector and individual citizens.',NULL,'2025-09-20 15:25:51'),(70631,'Transparency International UK & the global programme on Defence & Security, that is hosted by TI-UK, are a member of:',NULL,'2025-09-20 15:25:51'),(70632,'European Peacebuilding Liaison Office (EPLO) - https://eplo.org/about-us/member-organizations/',NULL,'2025-09-20 15:25:51'),(70633,'Global Alliance for Peace Operations: https://www.peaceoperations.net/members',NULL,'2025-09-20 15:25:51'),(70634,'Halving Global Violence Task Force: https://www.sdg16.plus/hgv-task-force/',NULL,'2025-09-20 15:25:51'),(70635,'UNCAC Coalition: https://uncaccoalition.org/about-us/members-list/',NULL,'2025-09-20 15:25:51'),(70636,'UK Anti-Corruption Coalition (UKACC) - https://www.ukanticorruptioncoalition.org/members',NULL,'2025-09-20 15:25:51'),(70637,'UK Open Government Network: https://opengovernment.org.uk/networks/uk/',NULL,'2025-09-20 15:25:51'),(70638,'Open Government Partnership Scotland Civil Society Steering Group: https://www.gov.scot/groups/open-government-partnership-steering-group/',NULL,'2025-09-20 15:25:51'),(70639,'Civil Society Organisations Steering Group (CSOSG) under the UK Economic Crime Plan: https://www.rusi.org/ecp/economic-crime-civil-society-organisations-steering-group#:~:text=The%20CSOSG%20is%20an%20independent,performance%20on%20tackling%20economic%20crime.',NULL,'2025-09-20 15:25:51'),(70640,'Scottish Alliance for Lobbying Transparency (SALT)',NULL,'2025-09-20 15:25:51'),(70641,'European Women\'s Lobby','85686156700-13','2025-09-20 15:25:52'),(70642,'Membre du Leaseurop',NULL,'2025-09-20 15:25:53'),(70643,'Membre de l\'EFA-EU European Driving Schools Associations',NUL