irective)','2025-09-20 15:04:15'),(123205,'7	Regulation (EU) 2024/1781 of the European Parliament and of the Council of 13 June 2024 establishing a framework for the setting of ecodesign requirements for sustainable products, amending Directive (EU) 2020/1828 and Regulation (EU) 2023/1542 and repealing Directive 2009/125/EC','2025-09-20 15:04:15'),(123206,'8	Regulation (EC) No 1935/2004 of the European Parliament and of the Council of 27 October 2004 on materials and articles intended to come into contact with food','2025-09-20 15:04:15'),(123207,'9	Commission Regulation (EU) 2022/1616 of 15 September 2022 on recycled plastic materials and articles intended to come into contact with foods, and repealing Regulation (EC) No 282/2008','2025-09-20 15:04:15'),(123208,'10	Regulation (EU) No 10/2011 of 14 January 2011 on plastic materials and articles intended to come into contact with food','2025-09-20 15:04:15'),(123209,'11	Communication from the Commission ‘A Competitiveness Compass for the EU’','2025-09-20 15:04:15'),(123210,'12	‘Much more than a market’, report by Enrico Letta','2025-09-20 15:04:15'),(123211,'13	‘The future of European competitiveness’, report by Mario Draghi','2025-09-20 15:04:15'),(123212,'14	Communication from the European Commission ‘Contingency plan for ensuring food supply and food security in times of crisis’','2025-09-20 15:04:15'),(123213,'15	Regulation (EU) 2020/852 (Taxonomy) on the establishment of a framework to facilitate sustainable investment','2025-09-20 15:04:15'),(123214,'16	Circular Plastic Alliance','2025-09-20 15:04:15'),(123215,'Politiche relative all\'edilizia abitativa','2025-09-20 15:04:18'),(123216,'Reviewing and analysing EU policy and legislative framework in order to comment on EDPB Opinion  includes time considering status of competition law authorities consideration of EU data strategy, EU digital services legislation the Digital Markets act provisions on personal data and recent case law from CJEU on topics related to 