 AI Act, GPAI code of practise','2025-09-20 15:07:08'),(123859,'revise OSH Framework Directive (89/391 EEC) and specifically in the 1989 Directive on workplace requirements (89/654/EEC)','2025-09-20 15:07:09'),(123860,'EU initiatives in the area of animal welfare, animal health, animal diversity, ethics, food security, research and development, technology development, transport, trade','2025-09-20 15:07:09'),(123861,'In particular EFEE follows EU initiatives in the field of Education and Training, Research, Social Affairs, Employment and Inclusion Key themes for EFEE are: Economic case for education and training Vocational education and training Citizenship and integration of migrants Open and innovative education Transition from education to employment Supporting early career researchers Healthy and save schools School leadership and self-evaluation','2025-09-20 15:07:10'),(123862,'In 2025, EFEE will on working, among others, on the following key themes:','2025-09-20 15:07:10'),(123863,'• promoting environmental sustainability   in   school   learning,   teaching   and   management','2025-09-20 15:07:10'),(123864,'•strengthening education employers’ capacity in order to promote innovation in education institutions in   a   post-Covid-19   era','2025-09-20 15:07:10'),(123865,'•addressing   psychosocial   risks   for   an   equitable  and sustainable education-led recovery from the COVID-19 pandemic','2025-09-20 15:07:10'),(123866,'Gebr Heinemann supports the European Travel Retail Confederation in working with Members of the European Parliament as well as Representatives of EU-Institutions on relevant Directives and Regulations that are of interest to the travel-retail industry This applies, for example, to EU Regulation No 1169/2011, where we have supported a uniform language for food labeling throughout the EU We are also following the developments of the VAT package for travel and tourism, possible amendments to the Tobacco Products Directive (2014/40/EU), particularly with regard to the impact on the travel-retail sector, as well as the introduction of national deposit return systems as part of the Packaging and Packaging Waste Regulation (P9_TA(2024)0318) In general, we follow European transport policy, in particular sea and air transport issues, legislation relating to products sold in travel retail, customs and taxation, including travelers allowances, and other relevant legislation for the travel-retail market','2025-09-20 15:07:11'),(123867,'We follow legislative files and initiatives related to telecommunications, digital, data protection and data economy, cybersecurity and sustainability This includes, among others, the following legislative proposals: Gigabit Infrastructure Act, Data Act, Digital Markets Act, AI Act, ePrivacy Regulation, e-evidence, GDPR, Cyber Resilience Act, EU Taxonomy, etc','2025-09-20 15:07:12'),(123868,'As a company headquartered in the UK and with a European-wide footprint serving businesses and governmental institutions with ICT solutions, we take a strong interest in the future EU-UK relationship','2025-09-20 15:07:12'),(123869,'Environment,','2025-09-20 15:07:16'),(123870,'Safety and Technical matters','2025-09-20 15:07:16'),(123871,'Research and development,','2025-09-20 15:07:16'),(123872,'Industry policy,','2025-09-20 15:07:16'),(123873,'Trade and Competitiveness policies','2025-09-20 15:07:16'),(123874,'Competition policy,','2025-09-20 15:07:16'),(123875,'Transport policy,','2025-09-20 15:07:16'),(123876,'Social Dialogue and Skills','2025-09-20 15:07:16'),(123877,'Defence','2025-09-20 15:07:16'),(123878,'Energy Transition Partnership for EU Fisheries and Aquaculture','2025-09-20 15:07:16'),(123879,'Rafaelo Resort targets key EU policies aligned with the European Green Deal and the EU Sustainable Tourism Agenda Our strategic objectives directly support the \"Transition Pathway for Tourism\" policy, focusing on reducing carbon emissions, implementing energy efficiency measures (aligned with EU Directive 2018/2002 on energy efficiency), and promoting the circular economy (EU Circular Economy Action Plan 2020) Additionally, the project contributes to the European Pillar of Social Rights by enhancing workforce skills through the Rafaelo Academy, fostering youth employment, and reducing social inequalities The resort also aligns with the EU Digital Transformation Strategy by integrating smart tourism solutions and advanced digital platforms in guest services and operational efficiency','2025-09-20 15:07:18'),(123880,'ProCredit Bank AG intends to participate in an event on the EU Commission\'s Implementation Dialogue on Private Sector Investment in the EU Enlargement and Eastern Neighborhood Countries with Marta Kos, EU Commissioner for Enlargement and Eastern Neighborhood, on 10062025','2025-09-20 15:07:19'),(123881,'- Le Pacte Vert pour l\'Europe (European Green Deal), en particulier les initiatives suivantes:','2025-09-20 15:07:20'),(123882,'* Le règlement pour une industrie « zéro net » (net-Zero Industry Act »','2025-09-20 15:07:20'),(123883,'* La mise en œuvre d’une stratégie pour la mobilité durable et intelligente (strategy for smart and sustainable mobility)','2025-09-20 15:07:20'),(123884,'* L\'inclusion du transport maritime dans le système d\'échange de quotas d\'émission de l\'UE (EU Emissions Trading System)','2025-09-20 15:07:20'),(123885,'* L\'initiative FuelEU Maritime','2025-09-20 15:07:20'),(123886,'* La révision de la directive 2003/96/CE sur la fiscalité énergétique (Energy Taxation Directive)','2025-09-20 15:07:20'),(123887,'* La révision de la directive 2014/94/EU sur le déploiement d\'une infrastructure pour carburants alternatifs (Alternative Fuels Infrastructure Directive)','2025-09-20 15:07:20'),(123888,'* La révision de la directive 2018/2001/EU relative à la promotion de l\'utilisation de l\'énergie produite à partir de sources renouvelables (Renewable Energy Directive)','2025-09-20 15:07:20'),(123889,'* La régulation de l’