portunity presents itself: Conference on the Future of Europe, Rule of Law framework, Ongoing response of the EU institutions to the Russian war of aggression in Ukraine, Transparency of the legislative process, including trilogue negotiations','2025-09-20 15:08:26'),(124246,'The EUROPARC Federation is active – both in terms of advocacy and implementation – in the following policy areas:','2025-09-20 15:08:27'),(124247,'EU Environmental Action program EU biodiversity strategy EU Green Deal Nature Directives Water Framework Directive Nature Restoration legislation EU Action Plan for People, Nature and Economy EU strategy for Smart, Sustainable & Inclusive Growth EU Vision to 2050 Roadmap to a Resource Efficient Europe Green Infrastructure Strategy EU Youth Strategy 2019-2027 EU Solidarity Corp initiative Common Agricultural Policy (CAP) EU Cohesion Policy EU 2050 Climate Strategy European Territorial Cooperation (ETC) Invasive Alien Species regulation Coexistence between people and large carnivores (European Platform) LIFE regulation','2025-09-20 15:08:27'),(124248,'At international level EUROPARC is also working in close cooperation with the Council of Europe to ensure, at wider scale, coherence and consistency of policies relevant for protected areas across Europe','2025-09-20 15:08:27'),(124249,'We carry out advocacy and information campaigns on national and regional level in Western Balkans to transpose the EU legislation on alternative fuels, specifically EU AFIR Regulations and EV charging standards','2025-09-20 15:08:28'),(124250,'- Common Foreign and Security Policy and Defence (CFSP/CSDP)','2025-09-20 15:08:29'),(124251,'- European Defence Industrial Strategy (EDIS)','2025-09-20 15:08:29'),(124252,'- European Defence Investment Programme (EDIP)','2025-09-20 15:08:29'),(124253,'- Defence Omnibus Package','2025-09-20 15:08:29'),(124254,'- Defence Procurement Directive','2025-09-20 15:08:29'),(124255,'- Intra-Community Transfer Directive','2025-09-20 15:08:29')