pharmaceutical manufacturing, distribution, and quality control','2025-09-20 15:10:04'),(124838,'Creation of a New Controlling Body: We support the establishment of a dedicated regulatory authority or controlling body in Ukraine modeled after EU agencies such as the European Medicines Agency (EMA) This body would oversee the approval, regulation, and monitoring of pharmaceutical products to ensure compliance with international standards and promote public health','2025-09-20 15:10:04'),(124839,'Mutual Recognition of GMP Certificates with the EU: We propose the mutual recognition of Good Manufacturing Practice (GMP) certificates between Ukraine and the EU This would streamline the process for Ukrainian pharmaceutical companies to obtain EU GMP certification, facilitating access to the European market and promoting cross-border trade in pharmaceutical products','2025-09-20 15:10:04'),(124840,'Alignment with EU Pharmacovigilance and Clinical Trial Regulations: We advocate for Ukraine to align its pharmacovigilance and clinical trial regulations with EU requirements This includes enhancing transparency, safety monitoring, and reporting of adverse drug reactions, as well as adopting standardized protocols for conducting clinical trials in line with EU guidelines','2025-09-20 15:10:04'),(124841,'ANASF follows the evolution of European legislation in the field of financial and insurance services, sustainable finance, digitalisation as well as all issues related to financial education','2025-09-20 15:10:05'),(124842,'In particular, ANASF follows the evolution of Mifid, CRD Directive, the IDD Directive, the Kid Priips Regulation, UCITS funds Directive and all the rules relating to sustainable finance','2025-09-20 15:10:05'),(124843,'Sprawiedliwość i sprawy wewnętrzne - problematyka wymiany informacji, baz danych, ochrony danych osobowych, retencji danych, współpracy w sprawach karnych i cywilnych','2025-09-20 15:10:05'),(124844,'Zagadnienia związane z polityką obrony (defens