ajtószabadság, átláthatóság, antikorrupció','2025-09-20 15:12:21'),(125614,'- Energy Efficiency Directive','2025-09-20 15:12:22'),(125615,'- Renewable Energy Directive','2025-09-20 15:12:22'),(125616,'- European Green Deal','2025-09-20 15:12:22'),(125617,'- REPowerEU','2025-09-20 15:12:22'),(125618,'- Gas package','2025-09-20 15:12:22'),(125619,'- The Green Deal Industrial Plan','2025-09-20 15:12:22'),(125620,'- Reform of electricity market design','2025-09-20 15:12:22'),(125621,'- Net-Zero Industry Act','2025-09-20 15:12:22'),(125622,'- Revision of the Energy Taxation Directive','2025-09-20 15:12:22'),(125623,'- Clean energy for all Europeans package','2025-09-20 15:12:22'),(125624,'- National energy and climate plans (NECPs)','2025-09-20 15:12:22'),(125625,'NABU is inter alia focusing on implementing the EU Green Deal and its EU Biodiversity Strategy to 2030, the EU Farm to Fork Strategy, etc NABU is also pushing for the implementation of existing EU legislation such as the EU Nature Restoration Regulation and the EU Birds and the Habitats Directives In general, NABU focuses on the conservation of nature Following the NABU motto “For humans and nature”, especially the implementation of EU environmental law, is a major topic for NABU and its groups Besides nature conservation, NABU also works on agriculture and fisheries, climate and energy, air quality, circular economy, and sustainable transport','2025-09-20 15:12:23'),(125626,'Digital Single Market, European Electronic Communications Code, Multiannual Financial Framework, Cybersecurity Act, ePrivacy Regulation, Revision of the Broadband Cost Reduction Directive / Gigabit Infrastructure Act, EU Relevant Market Recommendation, CEF2, Digital Services Act, Broadband State Aid, Broadband State Aid Guidelines, NGA and NDCM Access Recommendations, Fair Share / Sending Party Pays, Whitepaper on how to master Europe\'s digital infrastructure needs / \"DNA\", EU Taxonomy, CSRD','2025-09-20 15:12:26'),(125627,'Affari marit