riculture :  support to farmers\' organisations, both strengthening the organisations and giving support to their activities','2025-09-20 15:12:43'),(125682,'Política europea social y de empleo, política europea en el ámbito de la economía digital, política europea de I+D+I, política europea en materia de industria, pequeña y mediana empresa, medio ambiente, energía y cambio climático, política comercial y de inversión, política europea de mercado interior, asuntos económicos y monetarios, política fiscal, política europea de transportes y, todas aquellas iniciativas europeas susceptibles de impactar en la competitividad y desarrollo empresarial','2025-09-20 15:12:45'),(125683,'Implementation of the Food information regulation, trade agreements with Third Countries, animal welfare policies, additives, enzymes, Directive on the Unfair Trading Practices in the Food Supply Chain Microbiological criteria','2025-09-20 15:12:48'),(125684,'F2F Strategy Pigmeat - beef and poultry market situation Green Claims Biodiversity Strategy Green Deal and SFSs','2025-09-20 15:12:48'),(125685,'Review of the additives legislation/ smoke flavourings/trichinella/dry aged meat','2025-09-20 15:12:48'),(125686,'Cluster policy, Aviation and drone policies & regulations, Chips Act, ESG & Sustainable Finance, CSRD Reporting, RefuelEU, HORIZON EUROPE, Invest EU, REACH, Clean Aviation, Clean Hydrogen','2025-09-20 15:12:49'),(125687,'Biotech Act','2025-09-20 15:12:50'),(125688,'Life Sciences Strategy','2025-09-20 15:12:50'),(125689,'Pharmaceutical Strategy (including OMP legislation)','2025-09-20 15:12:50'),(125690,'SoHO legislation','2025-09-20 15:12:50'),(125691,'Industrial Strategy','2025-09-20 15:12:50'),(125692,'European Health Union and Preparedness','2025-09-20 15:12:50'),(125693,'Trade Strategy','2025-09-20 15:12:50'),(125694,'Open Strategic Autonomy','2025-09-20 15:12:50'),(125695,'The Bulgarian Chamber of Commerce and Industry (BCCI) is actively engaged in EU legislative initiatives and