ty rights, innovation, and anti-counterfeiting policies','2025-09-20 15:16:12'),(126702,'- Global supply chain issues','2025-09-20 15:16:12'),(126703,'- Corporate social responsibility','2025-09-20 15:16:12'),(126704,'- Consumer & product safety','2025-09-20 15:16:12'),(126705,'Encourage “cloud first” public procurement policy initiatives with a “comply or explain” requirement when costlier onsite proprietary computing is preferred over cloud infrastructures','2025-09-20 15:16:13'),(126706,'Promote coherent EU-wide security requirements and international technical security standards across all Member States','2025-09-20 15:16:13'),(126707,'Support IaaS specific cloud privacy requirements, including through a privacy Code of Conduct for Infrastructure providers','2025-09-20 15:16:13'),(126708,'Keep the EU cloud infrastructure market open, competitive and free from “lock-in” in single proprietary technologies or services','2025-09-20 15:16:13'),(126709,'Ensure that the EU legal framework takes due account of the particular features of IaaS cloud computing','2025-09-20 15:16:13'),(126710,'Contribute to reducing carbon footprint and use of energy-efficient cloud technologies','2025-09-20 15:16:13'),(126711,'Inno ShPK aligns its business strategy and operations with key European Union policies and legislative frameworks that support the transition to a circular economy, promote waste reduction, and encourage sustainable product innovation The main EU legislative proposals and policies targeted include:','2025-09-20 15:16:14'),(126712,'EU Circular Economy Action Plan (2020) EU Waste Framework Directive (2008/98/EC) Packaging and Packaging Waste Directive (94/62/EC, currently under revision)EU Industrial Emissions Directive (IED) (2010/75/EU) EU Strategy for Plastics in a Circular Economy EU Green Public Procurement (GPP) Criteria','2025-09-20 15:16:14'),(126713,'Recreational Craft Directive 2013/52/EU','2025-09-20 15:16:18'),(126714,'Machinery Regulation','2025-09-20 15:1