-09-20 15:17:12'),(126977,'H2020 program, such as SME intrument, Fast Track to Innovation, Factory of the future We are an italian SME which invest a lot of resources in research and developement','2025-09-20 15:17:13'),(126978,'Potential amendments of EU Regulations on ground handling (GH), Regulations (EU) No 965/2012 on air operations, (EU) No 139/2014 on aerodromes, (EU) 2022/1645 on information security','2025-09-20 15:17:14'),(126979,'Slot Regulation','2025-09-20 15:17:14'),(126980,'Revision of airport charges directive 2009/12/EC','2025-09-20 15:17:14'),(126981,'Reform Unionszollkodex, Sanktionen, Handelshemmnisse, Freihandelsabkommen, Exportkontrolle, AES 30, EU Green Deal','2025-09-20 15:17:15'),(126982,'Regeneron monitors and follows policies and initiatives related to its business, these include:','2025-09-20 15:17:16'),(126983,'Clinical Trial Regulation','2025-09-20 15:17:16'),(126984,'In Vitro Diagnostics Regulation','2025-09-20 15:17:16'),(126985,'Intellectual property','2025-09-20 15:17:16'),(126986,'Health Technology Assessment Regulation','2025-09-20 15:17:16'),(126987,'European Industrial Strategy','2025-09-20 15:17:16'),(126988,'Our activities fall within the scope of the Renewable Energy Directive, which provides the legal framework for the development of renewable energy across all sectors of the EU economy The Directive sets out common principles and rules to remove barriers, encourage investment, and reduce the costs of renewable energy technologies It also empowers citizens, consumers, and businesses to actively participate in the clean energy transition','2025-09-20 15:17:16'),(126989,'EU-Generalised Scheme of Preferences +','2025-09-20 15:17:17'),(126990,'EU Free Trade Agreements','2025-09-20 15:17:17'),(126991,'EU Development Aid programs','2025-09-20 15:17:17'),(126992,'Team Europe','2025-09-20 15:17:17'),(126993,'- Proposal for a regulation on a Single Market for Digital Services (Digital Services Act)','2025-09-20 15:17:18'),(126994,'Euro-Med Youth Federation’s  (EMYF) alignment with EU goals in digital transition, education, sustainability, and social inclusion positions it as a contributor to addressing the challenges and opportunities outlined in the communication regarding the evolution of digital services and the need for updated rules By contributing to digital literacy and skills, EMYF indirectly supports the objectives of updating rules and responsibilities for providers of digital services EMYF\'s diverse projects, including those related to green skills development and entrepreneurship, align with this perspective The COVID-19 crisis highlighted the importance of digital technologies and the risks associated with the current framework for digital services EMYF\'s projects that address social challenges exacerbated by the crisis and support vulnerable populations demonstrate its responsiveness to these concerns Through its projects and initiatives EMYF advocates for a regulatory framework that strikes a balance between fostering innovation and ensuring online safety and the protection of fundamental rights','2025-09-20 15:17:18'),(126995,'EMYF conducted public awareness campaigns to educate the general public about the importance of the proposed initiative and how it can contribute to online safety and protection of fundamental rights and engaged in constructive dialogue with various stakeholders to address concerns and refine the proposal for better effectiveness','2025-09-20 15:17:18'),(126996,'-European Parliament Resolution on the European Green Deal','2025-09-20 15:17:18'),(126997,'EMYF\'s involvement in projects related to environmental sustainability and green skills development aligns with the European Green Deal objectives Through its local and international activities EMYF educates and empowers youth and adults  to promote the goals of the European Green Deal EMYF collaborated with other NGOs, environmental organizations, and stakeholders to amplify the collective impact of our activities and to provide training sessions, workshops, and resources to help stakeholders, including policymakers, better understand the implications and opportunities of the European Green Deal','2025-09-20 15:17:18'),(126998,'-Council Decision on the system of own resources of the European Union','2025-09-20 15:17:18'),(126999,'EMYF hosted workshops to educate staff, volunteers, and community members, on the implications of the Council Decision and has the necessary expertise to develop educational materials that explain the potential impact of the decision on the communities','2025-09-20 15:17:18'),(127000,'Nuestra plataforma está principalmente interesada en políticas que tengan que ver con la garantía de acceso a los servicios básicos de agua y energía, en concreto, en relación a la reforma de las Directivas 2019/943, 2019/942 y 2019/944 en las que se establece la protección a los consumidores vulnerables Queremos hacer incidencia para ver como desde Europa puede trabajarse para que estas Directivas se transpongan en el ordenamiento jurídico español','2025-09-20 15:17:19'),(127001,'EU EcoDesign and Energy Label directives','2025-09-20 15:17:19'),(127002,'EU Solar Strategy','2025-09-20 15:17:19'),(127003,'EU Solar PV Industry Alliance','2025-09-20 15:17:19'),(127004,'EU Net Zero Industry Act','2025-09-20 15:17:19'),(127005,'PV Solar Charter','2025-09-20 15:17:19'),(127006,'DG GROW – I2, Driver’s Behaviour Assessment Systems subgroup','2025-09-20 15:17:20'),(127007,'SaverOne participates in the committees meetings and contributes to promoting the regulation draft Our experience with driver distraction and behavior enables us to provide valuable insights, use cases and data to the committee','2025-09-20 15:17:20'),(127008,'•	Net Zero Industry Act','2025-09-20 15:17:21'),(127009,'•	Strategic Technologies for Europe Platform','2025-09-20 15:17:21'),(127010,'•	The European Hydrogen Bank','2025-09-20 15:17:21'),(127011,'•	The Gas and Hydrogen Package','2025-09-20 15: