9-20 15:19:25'),(127587,'Transport Policy','2025-09-20 15:19:26'),(127588,'Motorcycle related measures','2025-09-20 15:19:26'),(127589,'Road Safety','2025-09-20 15:19:26'),(127590,'PPE','2025-09-20 15:19:26'),(127591,'Vehicle Licensing, Training and Testing','2025-09-20 15:19:26'),(127592,'Type Approvals','2025-09-20 15:19:26'),(127593,'Import/Export initiatives','2025-09-20 15:19:26'),(127594,'Business Policy','2025-09-20 15:19:26'),(127595,'Gemeinsame Agrarpolitik wird beobachtet, da hier der größte Einfluss auf die Biodiversität vorliegt Außerdem Regularien zur invasiven Neobiota','2025-09-20 15:19:27'),(127596,'White Paper for European Defence – Readiness 2030','2025-09-20 15:19:28'),(127597,'All animal feed legislation (labelling, additives, feed material, veterinary legislation)','2025-09-20 15:19:29'),(127598,'Environment (PEFCR, Packaging, Green claims)','2025-09-20 15:19:29'),(127599,'Animal welfare','2025-09-20 15:19:29'),(127600,'Currently ISSA is involved in the following European projects:','2025-09-20 15:19:30'),(127601,'1 TOY for Participation: TOY4Participation is an innovative project that promotes meaningful child participation in Early Childhood Education and Care (ECEC) settings, with a particular focus on non-formal community based early childhood services like Play Hubs These hubs provide safe, inclusive environments where all children can actively engage in their own learning and decision-making The initiative empowers children aged 0-10, including those underrepresented such as migrants, refugees, Roma, and children with special needs, to express their views and influence decisions that impact them Building on the success of the TOY for Inclusion programme—which established so far 40 Play Hubs in Europe to pro','2025-09-20 15:19:30'),(127602,'2 CHAVORE (which means \"children\" in Romani language) is an initiative committed to enhancing the mental health and well-being of young children aged 0-6, particularly in vulnerable communities such as Roma This initiative addresses the critical developmental needs of young children, especially during their early years, by fostering environments that promote physical and mental health and well-being CHAVORE’s work is rooted in cultural sensitivity and evidence-based practices, making it a unique approach that supports young children and families experiencing exclusion and discrimination  and the professionals who care for them','2025-09-20 15:19:30'),(127603,'Commission proposal on a targeted amendment of the wolf protection status (7 March 2025)','2025-09-20 15:19:30'),(127604,'Proposal for new rules on the welfare of dogs and cats and their traceability (7 December 2023)','2025-09-20 15:19:30'),(127605,'EU Green Deal, hållbarhetslagstiftning, handelspolitik, industri- och forskningspolitik','2025-09-20 15:19:31'),(127606,'Bemanningsvoorschriften binnenvaart: publieke consultatie','2025-09-20 15:19:35'),(127607,'Milsped targets several EU policy areas aligned with its strategic development priorities, especially in the fields of sustainable transport, green logistics, digital transformation, and regional integration','2025-09-20 15:19:36'),(127608,'Key legislative proposals and frameworks of interest include:','2025-09-20 15:19:36'),(127609,'European Green Deal – Milsped supports the EU’s climate-neutrality goals by investing in low-emission transport, multimodal logistics platforms, and infrastructure for electric and alternative-fuel vehicles','2025-09-20 15:19:36'),(127610,'Sustainable and Smart Mobility Strategy (COM/2020/789) – The company actively follows policies promoting smart freight transport, last-mile electrification, cross-border connectivity, and digital logistics ecosystems','2025-09-20 15:19:36'),(127611,'TEN-T Regulation (Proposal COM/2021/812 final) – Milsped operates strategically along core transport corridors and is engaged in enhancing regional multimodal connections in line with the revision of the Trans-European Transport Network','2025-09-20 15:19:36'),(127612,'Alternative Fuels Infrastructure Regulation (AFIR) – Relevant for Milsped’s development of electric vehicle charging infrastructure in logistic hubs and investment in HVO and biogas-based transport solutions','2025-09-20 15:19:36'),(127613,'Fit for 55 Package – Especially the parts relating to road transport decarbonisation, carbon pricing, and energy efficiency in logistics operations','2025-09-20 15:19:36'),(127614,'Digital Europe Programme / EU Data Strategy – Milsped is committed to adopting smart warehouse solutions, automation, and AI-based systems for transport planning and supply chain optimization','2025-09-20 15:19:36'),(127615,'EU Enlargement and Connectivity Agenda for the Western Balkans – Milsped supports the integration of regional logistics infrastructure with EU markets, contributing to sustainable trade corridors and supply chain resilience across the region','2025-09-20 15:19:36'),(127616,'Circular Economy Action Plan – Through investments in reusable packaging, route optimization, and reduced waste in transport and warehousing processes','2025-09-20 15:19:36'),(127617,'Connecting Europe Facility (CEF) – Milsped monitors relevant funding calls and initiatives aimed at modernizing cross-border transport infrastructure and digital logistics systems','2025-09-20 15:19:36'),(127618,'Milsped participates in EU-funded projects and cross-sectoral initiatives supporting the alignment of logistics operations with EU decarbonisation targets and regional development objectives The company’s interest in these policies stems from its active role in shaping a modern, efficient, and green logistics network in Southeast Europe and beyond','2025-09-20 15:19:36'),(127619,'Der VVO begleitet EU­-Rechtsetzungsvorhaben, die für die österreichische Versicherungswirtschaft relevant sind Ua Aufsichtsrecht, Nachhaltige Finanzierung, Solvency II, Insurance Recovery and Resolution Directive (IRRD),  Versicherungsvermittlung (IDD, Retail Investment Strategy), Kapitalmarktunion, Digitalisierung, Datenschutz, Motor Insurance Directive (MID), Straßenverkehrssicherheit, Versicherung von Naturkatastrophen, Internationale Rechnungslegungsstandards, Initiativen von EIOPA und ESMA Neben der Erarbeitung und Vertretung von koordinierten Positionierungen der österreichischen Versicherungswirtschaft bestehet der überwiegende Teil der Aktivitäten des VVO im Monitoring der relevanten EU-­Rechtsetzungsvorhaben, der Mitwirkung an den Gremien des europäischen Dachverbandes Insurance Europe und gegenüber den Mitgliedsunternehmen, die die EU-Regeln in ihren Unternehmen implementieren müssen, in der Informationsaufbereitung, Erklärung von EU-­Initiativen sowie Beratung zu deren Umsetzung','2025-09-20 15:19:37'),(127620,'We comply with EU Emissions Trading System (EU ETS), FI FOR 55, EU PASSENGER RIGHTS , CO2 EMISSIONS FOR PASSENGER SHIPS','2025-09-20 15:19:38'),(127621,'Continuous investment in new technologies and to implement environment-friendly methods','2025-09-20 15:19:38'),(127622,'Active participation in organizations that promote the principles of environmental safety and protection','2025-09-20 15:19:38'),(127623,'Participation in international research and development programs that promote efficiency, accountability and pollutants reduction within the shipping sector','2025-09-20 15:19:38'),(127624,'To be constantly updated on environmental issues and to adopt new cutting edge practices regarding the environment','2025-09-20 15:19:38'),(127625,'The Group companies Superfast Ferries and Blue Star Ferries were the first companies of the passenger-shipping sector that received the ISO 14001:1996 Environmental Management certification The Group ships have all received the same certification Furthermore, the effectiveness and dynamics of said Environmental Management System are certified by the American Certification Body \'\'ABS Quality Evaluations\'\', of the International Group of Companies \'\'American Bureau of Shipping