o protecting the sexual and reproductive rights (SRHR) of all people, both in Europe and overseas','2025-09-20 15:20:19'),(127745,'Moreover, AIDOS also regularly takes part in consultations, such as the recent ones on Gender Equality and LGBTQI+ strategies','2025-09-20 15:20:19'),(127746,'We plan to work and help the DG TAXUD, they are building a new European centralized agency for boarders and a data hub to treat all the different packages that go through it, and we would like to help them in the infrastructure/cloud side of it, by making sure that all data remains within the EU, working solely with a sovereign EU cloud provider','2025-09-20 15:20:20'),(127747,'Boligpolitik','2025-09-20 15:20:21'),(127748,'We are currently conducting world-leading research in diverse areas such as quantum nano, bio-nano, maritime technology, engineering, transport, water management, aerospace technology and robotics Therefore we follow the main legislative proposals in these policy areas, like the chips act, the data act, etc','2025-09-20 15:20:22'),(127749,'European Digital Innovation Hubs (EDIH)','2025-09-20 15:20:23'),(127750,'European Innovation Council (EIC)','2025-09-20 15:20:23'),(127751,'Interregional Innovation Investement (I3)(EISMEA)','2025-09-20 15:20:23'),(127752,'Research and Innovation agenda','2025-09-20 15:20:23'),(127753,'Next Generation EU','2025-09-20 15:20:23'),(127754,'SME and Industrial Strategy','2025-09-20 15:20:23'),(127755,'EU Programme for Employment and Social Innovation (EaSI)','2025-09-20 15:20:23'),(127756,'Currently we follow the Europen Regulation on Deforestation (EUDR), LULUCF and RED as well as the Mercosur agreement','2025-09-20 15:20:24'),(127757,'Planul de Creștere pentru Republica Moldova','2025-09-20 15:20:25'),(127758,'Acordul de Asociere și Zona de Liber Schimb Aprofundat și Cuprinzător (DCFTA)','2025-09-20 15:20:25'),(127759,'DIRECTIVE (EU) 2024/1069 OF THE EUROPEAN PARLIAMENT AND OF THE COUNCIL','2025-09-20 15:20:25'),(127760,'of 11 Apr