ntation of the Windsor Framework in all its parts','2025-09-20 15:22:46'),(128395,'Immateriaalioikeuksiin, erityisesti teollisoikeuksiin, liittyvä lainsäädäntö ja täytäntöönpano, kauppa- ja tullipolitiikka IP crime, Taxation and Customs, EUIPO and Europol proposals and policies','2025-09-20 15:22:47'),(128396,'Systemair follows the following policies:','2025-09-20 15:22:48'),(128397,'- Ecodesign for Sustainable Products Regulation (ESPR), incl Digital Products Passport (DPP','2025-09-20 15:22:48'),(128398,'- Ecodesign and Energy Labelling for HVAC (eg, ENER Lot 1 for space heaters, ENTR Lot 6 for ventilation, ENER Lot 10 for ACs and comfort fans, ENER Lot 11 for fans, ENER Lot 20 for local space heaters, ENER Lot 21 for air heating and cooling)','2025-09-20 15:22:48'),(128399,'- Machinery Directive','2025-09-20 15:22:48'),(128400,'- Indoor Environmental Quality (including Indoor Air Quality, or IAQ)','2025-09-20 15:22:48'),(128401,'3) Sustainability','2025-09-20 15:22:48'),(128402,'- REACH, RoHS','2025-09-20 15:22:48'),(128403,'4) Smart HVAC','2025-09-20 15:22:48'),(128404,'5) Standardisation for HVAC','2025-09-20 15:22:48'),(128405,'L\'UNAPL suit toute législation et initiative européenne pouvant impacter les entreprises libérales Elle est particulièrement vigilante sur tout projet susceptible d\'affaiblir le niveau d\'exigence en matière de qualité et de sécurité des services libéraux Les conditions de la circulation des services libéraux au sein du marché intérieur sont un enjeu déterminant pour l\'UNAPL Elle suit, par conséquent, de très près l\'application et la mise en oeuvre de  la directive 2006/123 du 12 décembre 2006 relative aux services dans le marché intérieur et la directive 2013/55 du 20 novembre 2013 relative à la reconnaissance des qualifications professionnelles Elle reste très attentive à la législation Omnibus qui est en cours ainsi que la directive et également sur la directive 2023/970 relative à la transparence des rémunérations Elle demeure vigilante sur toute proposition de réforme des services réglementés, que ce soit au niveau européen ou au niveau national, lors de  la transposition Toutes les initiatives relatives aux services et marchés numériques, à l\'intelligence artificielle, ainsi qu\'à la protection des données sont également au centre de ses préoccupations Enfin, toutes les initiatives visant à adapter la législation européenne au secteur des petites entreprises (Small Business Act, développement de l\'entrepreneuriat en Europe, toute mesure de soutien aux MPME) intéressent, par ailleurs, l\'UNAPL, de même que celles se rattachant à des problématiques générales propres à intéresser toutes les entreprises (compétences, emploi des jeunes, etc) De nouveaux aspects des politiques de l\'UE mobilisent enfin l\'UNAPL, tels que l\'extension de la protection sociale aux indépendants, la protection des travailleurs intellectuels recourant, pour offrir leurs services, aux plateformes d\'intermédiation en ligne, ou encore l\'Europe de la santé','2025-09-20 15:22:49'),(128406,'L\'UNAPL a créé en son sein en juin 2021 une commission Outre- mer et suit depuis l\'actualité européenne relative aux régions ultra- périphériques (RUP)','2025-09-20 15:22:49'),(128407,'DIRECTIVE OF THE EUROPEAN PARLIAMENT AND OF THE COUNCIL on protecting persons who engage in public participation from manifestly unfounded or abusive court proceedings (“Strategic lawsuits against public participation”)','2025-09-20 15:22:50'),(128408,'Proposal for a DIRECTIVE OF THE EUROPEAN PARLIAMENT AND OF THE COUNCIL on combating corruption, replacing Council Framework Decision 2003/568/JHA and the Convention on the fight against corruption involving officials of the European Communities or officials of Member States of the European Union and amending Directive (EU) 2017/1371 of the European Parliament and of the Council','2025-09-20 15:22:50'),(128409,'Internal Market (type approval framework, exhaust emissions, general safety regulation, weights and dimensions of heavy duty vehicles, roadworthiness)','2025-09-20 15:22:53'),(128410,'External trade (free trade agreements, trade defence instruments)','2025-09-20 15:22:53'),(128411,'Climate action (CO 2 emissions from passenger cars, light commercial vehicles and heavy duty vehicles,  alternative fuel infrastructure, batteries, renewable energy, energy taxation, sustainable finance)','2025-09-20 15:22:53'),(128412,'Transport policy (road charging, urban mobility, ITS)','2025-09-20 15:22:53'),(128413,'Environment (end-of-life vehicles, resource efficiency, circular economy, fuel quality, chemicals, REACH)','2025-09-20 15:22:53'),(128414,'Digital Agenda (connected and automated driving, GDPR, e-privacy, cybersecurity, artificial intelligence, data sharing)','2025-09-20 15:22:53'),(128415,'Competition (vertical and automotive block exemption regulations, licensing of standard essential patents)','2025-09-20 15:22:53'),(128416,'Competitiveness (Net Zero Industry Act, Critical Raw Materials Act)','2025-09-20 15:22:53'),(128417,'Under Horizon Europe funding programme (2021 – 2027), FEUP is a partner in 18 funded projects (OPENZDM, PULSELiON, ADOreD, DIAMOND, AWARE, SINNOGENES, DocTalent4EU, AISym4Med, DiverSea, AptWind, Just Streets, DuneFront, RESURGENCE, REESOURCE, RETIME, Intelliwind, PhDs EU-Rail and TAILWIND-UP-HopOn) and the coordinator of 6 projects (eBiofilm, ERA-ARE, InBridge4EU, EU-DREAM, InnovAntiBiofilm and ZeroCarb)','2025-09-20 15:23:13'),(128418,'Under Horizon 2020 funding programme, FEUP was a partner in 35 funded projects (Marine UAS, BRIDGES, ICI-THROUGH, IN2RAIL, HYDRALAB-PLUS, FAME, ANTAREX, HEAT-SHIELD, RISEN, PRINTCR3DIT, LIQUEFACT, PRINT-AID, OPTICON, SERA, SimuSafe, InnoDC, IN2STEMPO , OptiMACS, PROSEU, SPRINT, RE-CITY, IN2TRACK2, RECLAIM, TREAL, LIKE, EuroSea, CHAMELEONS, MOVING TOGETHER, BugWright2, EMPOWER, NEWFRAC, GROOM II, REMARO, IN2TRACK3 and ORP) and is/has been the coordinator of 9 other funded projects (SDIN, SmartHELMET, GOTSolar, EUMarineRobots, DelNAM, SED, SurfSAFE, 112CO2 and TEMPEST)','2025-09-20 15:23:13'),(128419,'Concerning other international funds, since 2014 until the present day, FEUP has also been very successful in programmes such as: EEA Grants (4 funded projects as coordinator and 6 as partner), COST (3 Coordinated actions, 19 actions as participant), ECHO (2 projects funded as Partner), CEF (1 project funded as Partner), Interreg (1 project funded as Coordinator, 17 projects funded as Partner), ERA-NET/COFUNDS (6 projects funded as Coordinator and 16 projects funded as Partner), RFCS (2 projects funded as Partner), UCPM (4 projects funded as Partner) and EIT Manufacturing (participation in 11 projects as coordinator and in 19 projects as partner) Furthermore, FEUP was the coordinator of a pilot project of EIT HEI Initiative - Innovation Capacity Building for Higher Education (INVENTHEI) and its follow-up project (Deep INVENTHEI)','2025-09-20 15:23:13'),(128420,'We are submitting our application in response to the European Commission’s Call for Expressions of Interest for EU/EEA/Western Balkans-based businesses to invest in the Western Balkans','2025-09-20 15:23:13'),(128421,'Our company is actively engaged in the development of renewable energy projects, with a strong focus on solar power We are committed to supporting the green energy transition and contributing to sustainable economic growth in the region Our portfolio includes ground-mounted solar power plants and energy efficiency solutions at the industrial level','2025-09-20 15:23:13'),(128422,'EU Port Strategy, FuelEU, AFIR, ETS, TEN-T, CEF','2025-09-20 15:23:14'),(128423,'cargo ferroviario trasporti combinati trasporti intelligenti tassazione energia finanziamento reti transeuropee','2025-09-20 15:23:15'),(128424,'We have strong interest in  EU  policy initiatives and regulations related to sustainable terrestrial livestock farming and aquaculture, including Research & Innovation, and sustainable food systems','