','2025-09-20 15:24:31'),(128659,'3 Policy controls according to the AI Act — Built-in governance rules that enforce development protocols, flag exceptions, and trace decisions back to organizational accountability','2025-09-20 15:24:31'),(128660,'“The Asenion fast-track for AI Act Governance will strengthen EU competitive power and at the same time provide pricing that is not only for the few”','2025-09-20 15:24:31'),(128661,'Anna Felländer, co-founder and President Asenion Europe','2025-09-20 15:24:31'),(128662,'- Creative Europe programme 2021–2027','2025-09-20 15:24:32'),(128663,'- Directive sur le droit d\'auteur dans le marché unique numérique','2025-09-20 15:24:32'),(128664,'-Artificial Intelligence Act','2025-09-20 15:24:32'),(128665,'-Audiovisual Media Service Directive (AVMSD)','2025-09-20 15:24:32'),(128666,'-Directive sur la diffusion en ligne et les retransmissions','2025-09-20 15:24:32'),(128667,'- EU-ETS: industrial, heat, transport, and shipping sectors EU-ETS reform','2025-09-20 15:24:32'),(128668,'- RePower EU','2025-09-20 15:24:32'),(128669,'- FuelEU maritime regulation','2025-09-20 15:24:32'),(128670,'- ReFuelEU Aviation regulation','2025-09-20 15:24:32'),(128671,'- Carbon Removals and Carbon Farming Directive','2025-09-20 15:24:32'),(128672,'EU CRCF - carbon removal framework, Green Claims, other EC climate actions','2025-09-20 15:24:33'),(128673,'Päämääriensä tavoittamiseksi yhdistys:','2025-09-20 15:24:34'),(128674,'- pitää yhteyttä EU:n ja Suomen julkiseen hallintoon ja politiikkoihin, energia-alan yrityksiin, järjestöihin, tiedotusvälineisiin sekä tutkimus- ja oppilaitoksiin,','2025-09-20 15:24:34'),(128675,'- tekee energia-alaan liittyviä aloitteita ja esityksiä EU:n ja Suomen julkiselle hallinnolle sekä antaa energiankäyttäjien asemaa koskevia lausuntoja ja kannanottoja,','2025-09-20 15:24:34'),(128676,'- tekee yhteistyötä  Euroopan Unionin, Pohjoismaiden ja Suomen tasolla toimivien osapuolten kanssa ja tarvittaessa edustaa niissä jäseniään','2025-09-20 15:24:34'),(128677,'EU Action Plan on Human Rights and Democracy','2025-09-20 15:24:35'),(128678,'A new agenda for the Mediterranean','2025-09-20 15:24:35'),(128679,'on plants obtained by certain new genomic techniques and their food and feed, and','2025-09-20 15:24:35'),(128680,'amending Regulation (EU) 2017/625','2025-09-20 15:24:35'),(128681,'COMMUNICATION FROM THE COMMISSION TO THE EUROPEAN','2025-09-20 15:24:35'),(128682,'PARLIAMENT, THE COUNCIL, THE EUROPEAN ECONOMIC AND SOCIAL','2025-09-20 15:24:35'),(128683,'COMMITTEE AND THE COMMITTEE OF THE REGIONS','2025-09-20 15:24:35'),(128684,'A Vision for Agriculture and Food','2025-09-20 15:24:35'),(128685,'Shaping together an attractive farming and agri-food sector for future generations','2025-09-20 15:24:35'),(128686,'Die Tourismus-Servicestelle beantwortet täglich individuelle Anfragen von Stakeholdern hinsichtlich der Anwendung der neuen Regelungen, direkte Anfragen der Branche und auch Beantwortung von Anfragen von Reisenden Weiters zeigt sie Problemfelder zu nationalen, europäischen und internationalen Vorhaben auf und verabschiedet ausführliche Stellungnahmen aus touristischer Sicht','2025-09-20 15:24:36'),(128687,'ATR closely monitors EU initiatives, policies and legislative initiatives that can impact its activity Most of them are related to aviation industry (safety, certification, EASA functioning…), international agreements (Trade Agreements, Bilateral Safety Agreements, Aviation Comprehensive Agreements…), environment, and R&D programs','2025-09-20 15:24:37'),(128688,'For instance, ATR has a particular interest in understanding and following the following procedures (this is a non-exhaustive list that can be subject to modification following EU initiatives, policies and legislative files release and/or update):','2025-09-20 15:24:37'),(128689,'-       Sustainable aviation fuels – ReFuelEU Aviation','2025-09-20 15:24:37'),(128690,'-       Environmental Label Programme - EASA','2025-09-20 1